{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"_kritt_extractor_helper\":true,\"stub\":false,\"stub_explanation\":\"\",\"results\":[{\"flow_summary\":\"An authenticated callback arriving synchronously while the raffle is still executing its wrapper request is ignored. The callback emits an audit event and returns without resolving the raffle or changing storage.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:101 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - ABI-decodes the wrapper-supplied requestId and uint256[] randomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Confirms msg.sender is the immutable configured wrapper.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:106 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Dispatches the decoded values to Raffle.fulfillRandomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:511 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - _requestInFlight is true, so the first short-circuit guard rejects the callback before request correlation or word validation.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:514 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Emits VrfCallbackIgnored with the supplied requestId, currently recorded vrfRequestId, and status.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:515 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Returns normally without changing raffle storage.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Emits VrfCallbackIgnored and returns without selecting a winner or mutating raffle storage.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":511,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The wrapper-supplied requestId is written to the VrfCallbackIgnored event as receivedRequestId. randomWords is ABI-decoded but, because the first guard short-circuits, neither its length nor its contents are inspected or persisted.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"The _requestInFlight guard is the callback-ordering boundary that prevents an authenticated synchronous callback from resolving before requestDraw has persisted the wrapper-returned request ID.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"An authenticated callback received while the raffle is not in Drawing status is ignored. This covers pre-draw callbacks, callbacks after refunds begin, and duplicate callbacks after an NftWon or CashWon resolution.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:101 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - ABI-decodes the wrapper-supplied requestId and uint256[] randomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Confirms msg.sender is the immutable configured wrapper.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:106 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Dispatches the decoded values to Raffle.fulfillRandomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:511 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - After confirming no request is in flight, status != Status.Drawing short-circuits the remaining callback checks.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:514 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Emits VrfCallbackIgnored with the supplied requestId, expected request ID, and current lifecycle status.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:515 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Returns normally without changing raffle storage.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Emits VrfCallbackIgnored and returns without reopening or replacing the raffle result.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":511,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The wrapper-supplied requestId reaches the ignored-callback event. randomWords is decoded but its length and contents are not inspected because the lifecycle check short-circuits.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"The status check enforces the lifecycle boundary around resolution and prevents early, post-refund, or duplicate authenticated callbacks from changing an existing or unavailable result.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"An authenticated callback presented during Drawing but carrying a request ID different from the raffle's recorded VRF request is ignored and logged.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:101 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - ABI-decodes the wrapper-supplied requestId and uint256[] randomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Confirms msg.sender is the immutable configured wrapper.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:106 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Dispatches the decoded values to Raffle.fulfillRandomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:511 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - With no request in flight and status Drawing, compares the supplied requestId to vrfRequestId and rejects a mismatch.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:514 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Emits VrfCallbackIgnored containing both the received and expected request IDs.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:515 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Returns normally without reading a random word or changing storage.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Emits VrfCallbackIgnored with the mismatched and expected request IDs, then returns without resolution.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":511,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The wrapper-controlled requestId drives the correlation failure and is logged as receivedRequestId beside the stored vrfRequestId. randomWords contents are not inspected or persisted.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"The request-ID comparison is the asynchronous correlation boundary ensuring that only the response associated with this raffle's recorded request can select its winner.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"An otherwise correlated authenticated callback whose randomWords array does not contain exactly one element is ignored and logged.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:101 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - ABI-decodes the wrapper-supplied requestId and uint256[] randomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Confirms msg.sender is the immutable configured wrapper.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:106 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Dispatches the decoded values to Raffle.fulfillRandomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:511 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - After the in-flight, lifecycle, and request-ID checks pass, rejects randomWords.length != 1.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:514 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Emits VrfCallbackIgnored using the correlated request ID and current state.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:515 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Returns without indexing the array or changing raffle storage.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Emits VrfCallbackIgnored and returns without consuming any random word.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":511,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The wrapper-controlled array length directly determines this validation outcome; its element values are discarded. The supplied requestId is correlated and then included in the ignored-callback event.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"The exact-length check enforces the one-word request shape before randomWords[0] is accessed and prevents malformed but ABI-decodable callback results from resolving the raffle.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"An authenticated, correctly correlated, one-word callback arriving at or after the exclusive two-day callback deadline is ignored. The raffle remains unresolved so the separate refund transition can proceed.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:101 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - ABI-decodes the wrapper-supplied requestId and uint256[] randomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Confirms msg.sender is the immutable configured wrapper.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:106 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Dispatches the decoded values to Raffle.fulfillRandomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:511 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - The in-flight, Drawing-status, request-ID, and one-word checks pass.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:463 Raffle.callbackDeadline - Derives the exclusive deadline from drawRequestedAt plus DRAW_CALLBACK_TIMEOUT.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:512 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Rejects the callback when block.timestamp is greater than or equal to the deadline.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:514 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Emits VrfCallbackIgnored and returns without selecting a winner.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Emits VrfCallbackIgnored and returns without resolution or storage mutation because the callback window has closed.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":512,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The wrapper-supplied requestId is validated and logged. randomWords must have length one, but its sole value is never read because the deadline check rejects the callback before winner selection.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"The deadline comparison is the liveness and state-transition boundary coordinating mutually exclusive late-callback and refund behavior; equality is deliberately treated as late.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"A timely, authenticated callback for the recorded request with exactly one word selects and stores a winning entry; when totalEntries meets or exceeds reserveEntries, it finalizes the raffle as NftWon and emits the result. No asset is transferred during the callback.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:101 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - ABI-decodes the wrapper-supplied requestId and one-element randomWords array.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Confirms msg.sender is the immutable configured wrapper.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:106 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Dispatches the authenticated values to Raffle.fulfillRandomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:511 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Confirms the request is no longer in flight, the status is Drawing, requestId matches vrfRequestId, and exactly one word was supplied.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:512 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Confirms the callback arrived strictly before callbackDeadline().\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:518 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Maps randomWords[0] to a one-based entry in [1,totalEntries] using modulo and addition.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:519 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Persists the selected winningEntry and records resolvedAt.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:521 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Because totalEntries >= reserveEntries, changes status from Drawing to NftWon.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:523 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Emits RaffleResolved with requestId, the selected entry, and NftWon.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Stores winningEntry and resolvedAt, sets status to NftWon, emits RaffleResolved, and returns without making an external call or transferring the prize.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":518,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The wrapper-controlled randomWords[0] is reduced modulo totalEntries and stored as winningEntry; the wrapper-supplied requestId must equal vrfRequestId and is emitted in RaffleResolved. The NftWon classification depends on stored totalEntries and reserveEntries, not on the selected word.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This is the randomness-to-winner sink: the authenticated word determines the bearer entry entitled to the escrowed NFT, while the same callback irreversibly commits the raffle to its NFT-result lifecycle.\"},{\"flow_summary\":\"A timely, authenticated callback for the recorded request with exactly one word selects and stores a winning entry; when totalEntries is below reserveEntries, it finalizes the raffle as CashWon and emits the result. Cash allocation and transfers occur only in later transactions.\",\"flow_trace\":[\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:101 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - ABI-decodes the wrapper-supplied requestId and one-element randomWords array.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Confirms msg.sender is the immutable configured wrapper.\",\"packages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:106 VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.rawFulfillRandomWords - Dispatches the authenticated values to Raffle.fulfillRandomWords.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:511 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Confirms the request is no longer in flight, the status is Drawing, requestId matches vrfRequestId, and exactly one word was supplied.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:512 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Confirms the callback arrived strictly before callbackDeadline().\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:518 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Maps randomWords[0] to a one-based entry in [1,totalEntries] using modulo and addition.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:519 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Persists the selected winningEntry and records resolvedAt.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:521 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Because totalEntries < reserveEntries, changes status from Drawing to CashWon.\",\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:523 Raffle.fulfillRandomWords - Emits RaffleResolved with requestId, the selected entry, and CashWon.\"],\"flow_terminal_action\":\"Stores winningEntry and resolvedAt, sets status to CashWon, emits RaffleResolved, and returns without allocating or transferring quote tokens.\",\"flow_file_path\":\"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\"flow_line\":518,\"flow_input_to_sink\":\"The wrapper-controlled randomWords[0] is reduced modulo totalEntries and stored as winningEntry; the wrapper-supplied requestId must equal vrfRequestId and is emitted in RaffleResolved. The CashWon classification depends on stored totalEntries and reserveEntries, not on the selected word.\",\"flow_security_relevance\":\"This is the randomness-to-winner sink for the cash-result lifecycle: it determines the entry whose ticket can later receive the cash-winner allocation and commits the raffle to CashWon without performing an external transfer in the callback.\"}]}"}}
